  "question": "What hotel can I find within 40 kilometers in the forward direction toward Lorimoto Gallery, Ridgewood, NY?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-73.979395 40.759034)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-73.906362 40.697925)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE tourism = 'hotel'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-73.979395 40.759034)',4326)::geography, 40000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-73.979395 40.759034)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
